---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <LegalPage
    title="Terms of Service"
    subtitle="The rules that govern your use of Wisdom Vault"
    updated="September 7, 2026"
  >
    <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>
      By creating an account, paying a membership or renewal fee, or using any part of the Wisdom Vault
      platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and by our
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must
      not create an account or use the platform.
    </p>

    <h2>2. The Service</h2>
    <p>
      Wisdom Vault is a premium learning platform that provides access to learning content, guides,
      premium packs, sponsored earning tasks and a referral program. We may add, change or remove
      features at any time, and we will do our best to give you reasonable notice of significant changes.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Accounts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You must provide accurate, current and complete information when registering, and keep it up to date.</li>
      <li>You are responsible for safeguarding your password and for all activity that happens under your account.</li>
      <li>You may only hold one account. Creating multiple or duplicate accounts is not allowed.</li>
      <li>You confirm you are at least 18 years old, or that you have the consent of a parent or guardian.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Membership &amp; Payment</h2>
    <p>
      Wisdom Vault is a paid membership service. You agree to pay the applicable registration and renewal
      fees shown on the platform. Access to paid content and earning features continues only while your
      membership is active and your payment has been verified. Failure to pay a renewal fee may result in
      loss of access until the fee is paid. All fees are non-refundable once paid. By paying any fee you
      confirm that you have read these Terms and understand and accept that the fee is non-refundable.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Referral Program</h2>
    <p>
      The referral program rewards you when you refer new members. Bonuses are paid only when the referred
      member completes registration and meets any eligibility requirements shown on the platform. Bonuses
      are not guaranteed and may be withheld or reversed if the referred account is found to be fraudulent,
      a duplicate, or created to abuse the program. Self-referrals and referral fraud are strictly prohibited
      and may lead to forfeiture of all bonuses and termination of your account.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Earnings &amp; Withdrawals</h2>
    <p>
      Earnings from referrals, sponsored tasks and other rewards are credited to your wallet when they
      become eligible. Withdrawals are subject to our fees, minimums and verification procedures, which we
      may update from time to time. We do not guarantee any level of earnings — all earning opportunities
      depend on activity, eligibility and program rules.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Acceptable Use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Create fraudulent, fake or duplicate accounts, or use the platform with stolen or unauthorised payment details.</li>
      <li>Engage in spam, harassment, or any activity that harms other users or the platform.</li>
      <li>Scrape, copy or redistribute platform content, pricing or member data without permission.</li>
      <li>Attempt to access accounts, systems or data you are not authorised to access.</li>
      <li>Use the platform for any unlawful purpose or in violation of local laws (including Malawian law).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>8. Content &amp; Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      All content on the platform — including courses, guides, ebooks, videos and designs — is the property
      of Wisdom Vault or its licensors and is protected by copyright. You may use content for your own
      personal learning only. You may not resell, redistribute or share access to paid content.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Consent</h2>
    <p>
      By registering you consent to the collection and processing of your personal information as described
      in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. Your consent and the date it was given are recorded on
      your account. If you withdraw consent, we may need to close your account.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Termination</h2>
    <p>
      We may suspend or terminate your account if you breach these terms, abuse the platform or the referral
      program, or if required by law. You may close your account at any time by contacting support. On
      termination for breach, unpaid bonuses may be forfeited.
    </p>

    <h2>11. No Guarantee of Income</h2>
    <p>
      Wisdom Vault provides earning opportunities, but we do not promise, guarantee or warrant any specific
      level of earnings, referral results or return on your membership fee. Any figures shown on the platform
      or in marketing materials are illustrative only.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, Wisdom Vault and its operators are not liable for any indirect,
      incidental or consequential damages arising from your use of the platform, including loss of earnings,
      data or goodwill. Our total liability for any claim is limited to the amount you actually paid us in the
      twelve months before the claim.
    </p>

    <h2>13. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms from time to time. When we do, we will update the date above and, where
      practical, notify you. Continued use of the platform after changes take effect means you accept the
      updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2>14. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms can be sent to our support team through the contact details available on
      the platform.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>